& [DirectFeatureContract] is minimal and explicit
  + [location] is crates\cantor_ecosystem\Cargo.toml target cfg(windows) dependencies
  + [version] is exactly =0.61.2
  + [default_features] is false
  + [features] are Win32_Foundation, Win32_Security, and Win32_Storage_FileSystem
  + [feature_reason] Win32_Storage_FileSystem exposes file APIs and structures
  + [feature_reason] Win32_Security is required for generated CreateFileW because its signature names SECURITY_ATTRIBUTES
  + [feature_reason] Win32_Foundation exposes HANDLE, GetLastError, and shared foundation types
  + [expected_lock_delta] is none because the exact registry package and windows-link dependency are already locked

& [CompileSurface] is closed
  + [functions] are CreateFileW, GetFileInformationByHandleEx, GetFinalPathNameByHandleW, GetVolumeInformationByHandleW, and GetLastError
  + [structures] are FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TAG_INFO, FILE_CASE_SENSITIVE_INFO, FILE_ID_INFO, FILE_STANDARD_INFO, FILE_STREAM_INFO, and FILE_REMOTE_PROTOCOL_INFO
  + [classes] are FileAttributeTagInfo, FileCaseSensitiveInfo, FileIdInfo, FileStandardInfo, FileStreamInfo, and FileRemoteProtocolInfo
  + [policy_constants] are no-follow, backup-semantics, open-existing, read-only access, full sharing, identity, stream, attribute, and volume capability constants
  + [ownership_type] is standard-library OwnedHandle and is not exercised by this probe

& [ProbeDesign] is compile and pure inspection only
  + [implementation] is one Windows-target integration test
  + [linkage_check] references generated function items but never invokes them
  + [ABI_check] inspects size_of, align_of, class codes, and exact policy constants
  + [execution] runs ordinary Rust assertions only
  + [production_module] is none
  + [non_Windows] does not build the Windows-only test body because the dependency is target-specific
  - never: construct a path buffer, open a handle, call an imported function, create an owning handle, read a file, enumerate a directory, query a volume, or inspect a candidate

